{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":9,"lang":"es","title":"Lo que pasa ahora","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"Qué vas a aprender a decir","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"En la lección 6 hablabas de lo que pasa siempre: I work, she cooks. Ahora vas a hablar de lo que pasa justo ahora, delante de ti: «estoy observando los pájaros», «el hielo se está derritiendo», «ella no está probando la mermelada»."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am observing the birds.","translation":"Estoy observando los pájaros.","hi":"am observing"},{"en":"The ice is melting.","translation":"El hielo se está derritiendo.","hi":"is melting"},{"en":"She is not tasting the jam.","translation":"Ella no está probando la mermelada.","hi":"is not tasting"},{"en":"Is the zipper working?","translation":"¿Funciona el cierre?","hi":"Is"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"Pieza + acción con -ing","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Aquí el español ayuda: «estoy mirando» es casi I am watching. am, is, are hacen de «estoy», y -ing hace de «-ando / -iendo». Pero el sujeto va siempre: I am watching, no Am watching."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"quién","accent":false},{"text":"am / is / are","accent":true},{"text":"acción + ing","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am observing the birds.","translation":"Estoy observando los pájaros.","hi":"am observing"},{"en":"She is watching a caterpillar.","translation":"Ella está mirando una oruga.","hi":"is watching"},{"en":"They are using a magnifier.","translation":"Están usando una lupa.","hi":"are using"},{"en":"I am knocking at the door.","translation":"Estoy tocando la puerta.","hi":"am knocking"},{"en":"A visitor is waiting.","translation":"Un visitante está esperando.","hi":"is waiting"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"Am observing the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"I observing the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"I am observe the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"She","after":"watching a caterpillar.","options":["is","are","—"],"answer":"is","why":"Antes de la acción con -ing va la pieza; con she, is."}}]},{"num":"03","title":"La pieza es la misma de la lección 1","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Cuál pieza usar lo decide «quién», como al principio del curso. I — am; he, she, it y una cosa — is; you, we, they — are: I am sighing, the ice is melting, we are marching."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am sighing with relief.","translation":"Estoy suspirando de alivio.","hi":"am"},{"en":"He is sneezing.","translation":"Él está estornudando.","hi":"is"},{"en":"The firefly is glowing now.","translation":"La luciérnaga está brillando ahora.","hi":"is"},{"en":"We are marching.","translation":"Estamos marchando.","hi":"are"},{"en":"The leaves are whirling.","translation":"Las hojas están dando vueltas.","hi":"are"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"The leaves is whirling.","right":"The leaves are whirling."},{"wrong":"We is marching.","right":"We are marching."}]}]},{"num":"04","title":"Cómo se escribe -ing","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Normalmente -ing se añade sin más: watch → watching. Si la palabra termina en una e muda, la e se quita: make → making. Si termina en vocal corta + una consonante, la consonante se duplica: sit → sitting, hop → hopping."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am making my portfolio.","translation":"Estoy armando mi portafolio.","hi":"making"},{"en":"I am sitting.","translation":"Estoy sentado.","hi":"sitting"},{"en":"I am submitting my work.","translation":"Estoy entregando mi trabajo.","hi":"submitting"},{"en":"The sparrow is hopping.","translation":"El gorrión está saltando.","hi":"hopping"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I am makeing my portfolio.","right":"I am making my portfolio."},{"wrong":"I am siting.","right":"I am sitting."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"I am","after":".","options":["siting","sitting","sit"],"answer":"sitting","why":"sit tiene vocal corta y una consonante, así que la t se duplica."}}]},{"num":"05","title":"«No» — not después de la pieza","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"En español «no» va delante: «no estoy». En inglés not va justo después de la pieza: I am not guessing, she is not tasting the jam. La acción con -ing se queda igual."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"quién","accent":false},{"text":"am / is / are","accent":true},{"text":"not","accent":true},{"text":"acción + ing","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am not guessing.","translation":"No estoy adivinando.","hi":"not"},{"en":"She is not tasting the jam.","translation":"Ella no está probando la mermelada.","hi":"not"},{"en":"They are not looking.","translation":"No están mirando.","hi":"not"},{"en":"The wax is not melting.","translation":"La cera no se está derritiendo.","hi":"not"},{"en":"The drummer is not marching.","translation":"El baterista no está marchando.","hi":"not"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I no am guessing.","right":"I am not guessing."},{"wrong":"She doesn't tasting the jam.","right":"She is not tasting the jam."},{"wrong":"They are not look.","right":"They are not looking."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"spot_slip","kind":"spot_slip","chips":["She","doesn't","tasting","the","jam"],"answerIndex":1,"hint":"Una palabra no va aquí. Tócala.","fix":"Con -ing, el «no» es is not: She is not tasting the jam."}}]},{"num":"06","title":"Pregunta: la pieza delante","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"La pregunta se arma como en la lección 2: la pieza va al principio. Is the ice melting? Are you inspecting the seam? Aquí no se usa do ni does; esos son para las costumbres."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"Am / Is / Are","accent":true},{"text":"quién","accent":false},{"text":"acción + ing","accent":false},{"text":"?","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Are you inspecting the seam?","translation":"¿Estás revisando la costura?","hi":"Are"},{"en":"Is she inspecting the lining?","translation":"¿Ella está revisando el forro?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is the zipper working?","translation":"¿Funciona el cierre?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is he sighing?","translation":"¿Está suspirando?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is the chocolate melting?","translation":"¿Se está derritiendo el chocolate?","hi":"Is"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"You are inspecting the seam?","right":"Are you inspecting the seam?"},{"wrong":"Do you inspecting the seam?","right":"Are you inspecting the seam?"}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Pregunta: «¿Se está derritiendo el chocolate?»","answer":["Is","the","chocolate","melting"],"distractors":["Does","melt"]}}]},{"num":"07","title":"¿Ahora o siempre?","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"En español «¿qué haces?» puede ser ahora. En inglés no: I wear a sweatshirt es «uso sudadera» (normalmente), y I am sweating es «estoy sudando» (ahora). Pregúntate: ¿es costumbre o es justo ahora?"},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I wear a sweatshirt.","translation":"Uso sudadera. *(normalmente)*","hi":"wear"},{"en":"I am sweating.","translation":"Estoy sudando. *(ahora)*","hi":"am sweating"},{"en":"The firefly is glowing now.","translation":"La luciérnaga está brillando ahora.","hi":"is glowing"}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Ahora mismo el hielo de la escalera se derrite. ¿Qué dices?","optionA":"The ice melts.","optionB":"The ice is melting.","correct":"B","explain":"Pasa ahora, así que is melting."}}]},{"num":"08","title":"Algo pasa — y dónde","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"A una frase sobre lo que pasa se le puede añadir dónde: She is in the doorway. I am near the carousel. Es la pieza de siempre con un lugar, sin -ing, porque no hay acción."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She is in the doorway.","translation":"Está en la puerta.","hi":"is"},{"en":"I am near the carousel.","translation":"Estoy cerca del carrusel.","hi":"am"},{"en":"She is murmuring to the baby.","translation":"Le está susurrando al bebé.","hi":"is murmuring"},{"en":"My hands are trembling.","translation":"Me están temblando las manos.","hi":"are trembling"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I am being near the carousel.","right":"I am near the carousel."}]}]},{"num":"09","title":"Los errores que comete casi todo el mundo","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"Am observing the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"I am observe the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"The leaves is whirling.","right":"The leaves are whirling."},{"wrong":"I am siting.","right":"I am sitting."},{"wrong":"I no am guessing.","right":"I am not guessing."},{"wrong":"You are inspecting the seam?","right":"Are you inspecting the seam?"}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"Dos partes siempre juntas: la pieza y -ing. Y siempre quién al principio. Si es ahora, -ing; si es costumbre, como en la lección 6."}]},{"num":"10","title":"Qué llevarte a la práctica","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Ahora: quién + am / is / are + acción con -ing. «No»: not después de la pieza. Pregunta: la pieza delante. Escribe con cuidado: making, sitting, hopping. Costumbre: como en la lección 6, sin -ing."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"They are using a magnifier.","translation":"Están usando una lupa.","hi":"are using"},{"en":"They are not looking.","translation":"No están mirando.","hi":"not"},{"en":"Is she inspecting the lining?","translation":"¿Ella está revisando el forro?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"I am submitting my work.","translation":"Estoy entregando mi trabajo.","hi":"submitting"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{"1":"02","2":"02","3":"02","4":"02","5":"02","6":"02","7":"02","8":"02","9":"05","10":"05","11":"05","12":"05","13":"05","14":"05","15":"05","16":"05","17":"06","18":"06","19":"06","20":"06","21":"06","22":"06","23":"06","24":"06","25":"07","26":"07","27":"07","28":"07","29":"07","30":"07","31":"07","32":"07","33":"04","34":"04","35":"04","36":"04","37":"04","38":"04","39":"04","40":"04","41":"08","42":"08","43":"08","44":"08","45":"08","46":"08","47":"08","48":"08","49":"08","50":"08","51":"08","52":"08","53":"08","54":"08","55":"08","56":"08"}}
